# Allowlist: ignore everything, then add back only what is safe to publish.
# Never commit: the ElevenLabs key file, the EPUB/PDF books, Swordsman's Companion photos
# (epub-images/, guard-photos/), reference/ notes and videos, or audio archives.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/index.html
!/drill-caller.html
!/drill-data.json
!/photos/
!/build.py
!/elevenlabs.py
!/generate_voice.py
